<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4823] SpringCache#putIfAbsent - wrong implementation</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4823</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Current implementation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; old;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (val == &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;)
    old = cache.withSkipStore().putIfAbsent(key, NULL);
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;
    old = cache.putIfAbsent(key, val);
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; old != &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt; ? fromValue(old) : &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;cache.putIfAbsent(key, val) - return boolean, not cached value&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Excepted behavior (according to the Spring-docs)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Object&lt;/span&gt; existingValue = cache.get(key);
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (existingValue == &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;) {
    cache.put(key, value);
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;
} &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; {
    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; existingValue;
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. Need to fix implementation&lt;br/&gt;
2. Cover SpringCache class with unit-tests&lt;/p&gt;</description>
