                            <comment id="15926414" author="vkulichenko" created="Wed, 15 Mar 2017 15:58:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Vyacheslav,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Very good catch on the bug! But the fix is completely wrong though &lt;img class=&quot;emoticon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/emoticons/smile.png&quot; height=&quot;16&quot; width=&quot;16&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt; Here are my comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;First of all, you call &lt;tt&gt;putIfAbsent&lt;/tt&gt; and then &lt;tt&gt;get&lt;/tt&gt; but this is not atomic and can produce incorrect result. There is &lt;tt&gt;getAndPutIfAbsent&lt;/tt&gt; method which you should use for this purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Do not remove &lt;tt&gt;withSkipStore&lt;/tt&gt; flag for &lt;tt&gt;NULL&lt;/tt&gt; value. It&apos;s a special flag value and it doesn&apos;t make sense to persist it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="15927600" author="daradurvs" created="Thu, 16 Mar 2017 07:07:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vkulichenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vkulichenko&quot;&gt;vkulichenko&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Thank you for notes. You&apos;re right.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ready for review, &lt;a href=&quot;http://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=500925&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;ci.tests&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
